# `hmz` on a command line: the version, and the commands there are.

Output "/out/cli.gif"

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1000
Set Height 620
Set Padding 12
Set Framerate 20
Set TypingSpeed 35ms

Hide
Type "cd /work/demo && clear" Enter
Show

Sleep 500ms
Type "hmz --version" Enter
Sleep 1500ms

Type "hmz --help" Enter
Sleep 5s
